  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up with our ACU Digital Camo Combat Uniform Pants. Featuring the Army Combat Uniform (ACU) digital camo pattern and near-military specifications, these uniform pants are great for active-duty personnel, camo enthusiasts, and more. The resilient cotton / polyester rip-stop fabric allows the combat pants to withstand training sessions and various outdoor conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "10282",
  "description": "<p>Gear up with our ACU Digital Camo Combat Uniform Pants. Featuring the Army Combat Uniform (ACU) digital camo pattern and near-military specifications, these uniform pants are great for active-duty personnel, camo enthusiasts, and more. The resilient cotton / polyester rip-stop fabric allows the combat pants to withstand training sessions and various outdoor conditions. Tried-and-True Reliability: These camo uniform pants are reinforced in the seat and knees for maximum durability that endures wear and tear while supporting a full range of motion. The wear-resistant double-stitched seams provide extra strength and years of reliable use as you train, ruck, sprint, hike, and climb. High-Capacity Storage: The ACU military pants feature a spacious 8 pocket design that consists of 2 hook &amp; loop cargo pockets, 2 hook &amp; loop lower leg pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 back flap pockets for storing field equipment and gear. The camouflage pants also come equipped with knee pad pouches (pads sold separately). Utility at the Forefront: The digital camo cargo pants feature a drawstring waist that enables the perfect fit. In addition, the straight leg opening fits over combat boots comfortable while the drawstring ankle ties allow you to easily adjust the fit. These camouflage pants utilize a button fly. All Things Camo: Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over six decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and military personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
